<FONT FACE="URW Palladio UNI">


<H3>HOW THIS FILE WAS MADE</H3>

<UL>
<li>Open Eva's file Akamindex.doc (dated 6 april 2004)
<li>Select everything
<li>Start "BlocNote" (NotePad)
<li>Paste, and save in UTF8 text format (NeEvaLst.utf)
<li>apply UTF_2pdy.bat and obtin a new file  (NeEvaLst.pdy)
<li>run the dos command: [find "v.r." NeEvaLst.pdy &gt; ne_vr.pdy
<li>"slightly" edit the result and make it into an hyperlinked file
<BR>(for instance make a search and replace of *.[0-9]* by ^J&lt;BR&gt;@*.?*, etc.
<li>interprete the statistics .......... (there seems to be 215 v.r. = verbal roots)
<li>Do the same with other categories
</UL>

<HR>
<H3>STATISTICS</H3>

<UL>
<li>Anthology name: Akanāṉūṟu (Neytal subset) (=AN, neytal; =NE)
<li>Anthology length: 658 lines
<li>Number of "v.r.": 215 occ. (of 116 distinct elements)
<li>Density of "v.r.": 215/658 = 33%
<li>Number of "ceyyum" type PE (peyar eccam): 86 occ. (of 70 distinct elements)
<li>Density of "ceyyum" type PE: 86/658 = 13.1 %
<li>Number of "ceyta" type PE (peyar eccam): 140 occ. (of 100 distinct elements)
<li>Density of "ceyta" type PE: 140/658 =  21.3 %
</UL>


